@Server_HostAddress = http://192.168.0.199:5236

### SmartHome.Server.Controllers.Clients.SwitchesController.GetSwitches

GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/clients/v1/switches
Accept: application/json
CONTENT-TYPE: application/json

### SmartHome.Server.Controllers.Clients.SwitchesController.GetSwitch
### Note: Update switch identifier in URL.

GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/clients/v1/switches/30002
Accept: application/json
CONTENT-TYPE: application/json

### SmartHome.Server.Controllers.Clients.SwitchesController.UpdateSwitch
### Note: Update switch identifier in URL and expected switch state in body.

PATCH {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/clients/v1/switches/30002
Accept: application/json
CONTENT-TYPE: application/json
{
  "expectedSwitchState" : true
}

### SmartHome.Server.Controllers.Clients.SensorsController.TakeMeasurement
### Note: Update sensor identifier in URL
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/clients/v1/sensors/1/measurement
Accept: application/json
CONTENT-TYPE: application/json
